<title>HUNGARY: ZWACK BOOSTS OP PROFIT, SALES IN H1.</title>
<headline>ZWACK BOOSTS OP PROFIT, SALES IN H1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	444	 vs	378</p>
<p>    Group profit before tax</p>
<p>	and extraordinaries	 281	 vs	202</p>
<p>    Group gross sales	   6,330	 vs    6,307</p>
<p>    Consumption tax	     2,489	 vs    2,698</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     3,841	 vs    3,609</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		1,876	 vs    2,001</p>
<p>    Gross profit		  1,965	 vs    1,608</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	582	 vs	491</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    164	 vs	142</p>
<p>    Other operating costs</p>
<p>     and expenditures	     775	 vs	597</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  163 loss  vs	176 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue		9	 vs	  1</p>
<p>     Financial expenditures     172	 vs	177</p>
<p>NOTE - Zwack Unicum Rt is a producer of alcoholic beverages. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
